ory Retirement\nG. Joseph Minetti, Member, Civil Aeronautics Board, will become subject to \nmandatory retirement for age on July 31, 1977, under the provisions of Section 8335 \nof Title 5 of the United States Code unless exempted by Executive order.\nIn my judgment, the public interest requires that G. Joseph Minetti be exempted \nfrom such mandatory retirement.\nNOW, THEREFORE, by virtue of the authority vested in me by subsection (c) \nof Section 8335 of Title 5 of tHe United States Code, I hereby exempt G. Joseph Minetti \nfrom mandatory retirement until September 30, 1977.\nT he W hite H ouse ,\nJuly 29, 1977.\n[FRDoc.77-22353 Filed 8-l-77;10:51 a.m.]","path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/texts/cd-job-fr-originals-12006-0625df4359.txt","sha256":"ad10e5b106c0744d36b1e78cf8c51c644290cc1ef531fd5d08ab9f3c29ca521f","source":{"line":2775,"path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"c0607c4b653b83b6ae8f6f67ee8e2766253a9f3adf379195fba8a2da9644d5d9"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Instrument: EO:12006\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1977-08-02/pdf/FR-1977-08-02.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: 0625df43597fe01eadfd718076a187f9af8ba07cb892ac6dcc0199bd121470ce\nLocation: 42 FR 39081, PDF pages 9-9 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 9 of 124 ===\npresidential docum ents\nTitle 3— The President\nExecutive Order 12006 July 29, 1977\nExemption of G. Joseph Minetti From Mandatory Retirement\nG. Joseph Minetti, Member, Civil Aeronautics Board, will become subject to \nmandatory retirement for age on July 31, 1977, under the provisions of Section 8335 \nof Title 5 of the United States Code unless exempted by Executive order.\nIn my judgment, the public interest requires that G. Joseph Minetti be exempted \nfrom such mandatory retirement.\nNOW, THEREFORE, by virtue of the authority vested in me by subsection (c) \nof Section 8335 of Title 5 of tHe United States Code, I hereby exempt G. Joseph Minetti \nfrom mandatory retirement until September 30, 1977.\nT he W hite H ouse ,\nJuly 29, 1977.\n[FRDoc.77-22353 Filed 8-l-77;10:51 a.m.]\nFEDERAL REGISTER, VOL. 42, NO. 148— TUESDAY, AUGUST 2, 1977\n","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_12006.txt","sha256":"d4b64d011593901d2ad5ac0e35c1923fe52732a68d4cb799f72a5e20f2f55c6e","source":{"line":1555,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"76da5836b3c224e85d96a73f2aefe1e69a76d38c5318a8fd5c50be78287c2452"}}]}
